        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Witooji na kūbūlaga numba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ūtoola nkīma, alīyo ūmbyeeda kūlwa kūmona alī na shilingo shilebe, hūna ūng'wandīkīla talaka ūmpeeja wīnga a ha ng'wakwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hanuma ya henaho ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūūkatoolwa na ngosha ūngī ipandī līngī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nū ngosha ng'wenūyo nang'hwe ūmbyeeda ūng'winha talaka, ūmpeeja a ha ng'wakwe; nūūlū hamo ū ngosha ng'wenūyo ūzumalīka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū ngosha ūyo walī antoolile kwandya ū nkīma ng'wenūyo, ūyo akang'winha talaka ūmpeeja, atazunīlījiwe ū kūnshokela hangī ū nkīma ng'wenūyo; nguno wamala kūsosohajiwa. Ū mhayo gwenūyo gūkūbiza gwa malofu ū kūlī SEEBA. Yaya ū kūyenhela būbi ī sī īyo SEEBA Mulungu wako alīkwinha kūbiza ya wingīji wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ūlū watoolile būhaha, atigeleelilwe kūtūng'wa kūja kū būlūgū, nūūlū kwinhwa milīmo midito yose yose. Shiigeleelilwe amale ng'waka ngima alī ha kaya akūnūngūjaga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Akūnūngūjaga:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, akūnyejaga.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ū nke wakwe ng'wenūyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo sha kūbagunanha bahabī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū alī na būgasa kūlī bebe, yaya ū kūsola iwe lyakwe lya kūshela nūūlū ī sho yaho, gīkī ūshidimīīle kūshisha aho alakūlīpe ū būgasa wakwe; nguno ūlū wīta gīko ū būgasa ūbo alī nabo kūlī bebe būkūbiza bokwenheleja kūntaaja shikolo sha kwigunanhīla mu būpanga wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ūding'wa wibaga ūmò wa baana ba ng'wawe a Baisilaeli, ūng'wīta kūbiza nsese wakwe nūūlū kūnjinja, ū ng'wibi wa munhū ng'wenūyo ni abūlagagwe. Shiigelile ūwīnje gete ū būbi ū mulī bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo ya būsaatu wa mbiji",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mbiji:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina līkatūmamīlagwa mu lūlīmi lwa Shihebulania koolecha būsaatu w'ikūnza lya mīlī, makanaza gangī ītī mbiji yenekīlī.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " shiigelile wīlole mu witegeleja būtaale; ītaga gīt'ūmo balakūwīlīle a bagabīji, a ba lūganda lwa Lawī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izūkagwa ūmo SEEBA akang'wītīla Miliamu ū mu nzīla aho ng'wafumaga Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūnzunīlīja nzenganwa ng'wiyo kūsola shikolo shako abize na būgasa kūlī bebe, ūtizingīla ū mu kaya yakwe kwisolela bebe ng'wenekīlī ī ndiimīli",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24:10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ndiimīli:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū ng'handīko. Shikolo īsho shikalekagwa kūlwa kwiza kūshoshiwa ūlū būgasa būshila.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe ikalaga hanze ūnindīīle akwenhele wei ng'wenekīlī ī shikolo īsho alīshifunya kūlwa būgasa ūbo alī nabo kūlī bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūlū ūbiza ng'habī, yaya ū kūjūlaala nasho kū ng'wako īsho alīkwinha kūlwa koolecha gīkī akūkūlīpa ū būgasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī līīmi ūlū lyūgwa nshokejage ī kache mbeho yakwe, alikumbe ī būjikū. Akūkūlūmba no, nīyo ū mu gīko ūkūbalīlwa būtūngīlīja ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtizūng'wiboneela ū munhū ng'habī ūlū akūtūmamaga ha ng'wako gīkī apandīke shose shose,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shose shose:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū mheela.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " abize Ng'wisilaeli ng'wiyo, nūūlū ūmò wa bageni abo bakwikalaga hamò nang'ho mu sī yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'winhage ī mheela yakwe ya būlī lūshikū aho līīmi lītaalī kūgwa, nguno ayisagīlilwe no īkī alī ng'habī; ūlū ītī chene akūnīlīīla SEEBA kūlwa nguno yako ūbalīlwe būkenaagūji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo sha kūbalang'hana bagayiwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A babyaji",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Babyaji:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, bababa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yaya ū kwinhwa nsango gwa kūbūlagwa kūlwa nguno ya būhūbi wa baana babo; na a baana batizinhwa nsango gwa kūbūlagwa kūlwa nguno ya būhūbi wa babyaji babo. Būlī munhū akūcha kūlwa nguno ya būhūbi bokwe wei ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kwīliganya ī ng'hana ū mu kalamulīle, ūlū ūlīnamula ngeni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ngeni:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, ūyo atī waho na kale ū mu sī, ng'wizīīji, nobeji.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nūūlū munhū wamala bakwe. Nū nchīlwa yaya ū kūng'wīngīja kache mbeho yakwe kūlwa nguno ya būgasa ūbo alī nabo kūlī bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izūkagwa gīkī ū bebe walī nsese u mu sī ya Misili, alīyo ū SEEBA Mulungu wako ūkūkomoola kūfuma ū mu sī yenīyo, h'ī nguno yene nalīkūlagīla kwīta ī mihayo yenīyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūlīgesa mu ngūnda gwako, hūna ūkīlanhya lyangala, yaya ū kūlīshokela. Līlekage, ūnekele ngeni nū yūyo wamala bakwe, nūūlū ū nchīlwa. Ūlū wīta gīko ū SEEBA Mulungu wako akūkwīlūkīla ū mu milīmo yose ya makono gako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū ūlīhūlūla matwajo ga mizeituni yako, yaya ū kūshokeela lūkangala lwa kabīlī ū kūbīta ū mu matambī ga mitī yenīyo; nekelage ngeni nū yūyo wamala bakwe, na nchīlwa, alize apūmbīīle nang'hwe īsho alabone mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī nū mu ngūnda gwa mizabibu, ūlū ūlīhūlūla ī mizabibu yako, yaya ū kūshoka mo lwa kabīlī; īsho shilīsaagīīla nekelage ngeni nū yūyo wamala bakwe, na nchīlwa. ",
          "type": "text",
